// The call under test, with whatever it needs wrapped around it: output
// captured for a prints/eprints clause, recording turned on for a calls
// clause (pre.id, post.id) -- or, for a case with none of these, exactly the
// call, unchanged.

emit_case_call_wrapped(int ci) {
  emit_capture_pre(ci);
  emit_case_call(ci);
  emit_capture_post(ci);
} return void;
